message: "If you use this work or the VIBE Loop framework, please cite it as below."
title: "Vibe Coding: A Practical Guide to Context-Engineered Prototyping"
abstract: >-
  A workshop introducing Vibe Coding, a method for designing AI interactions
  that preserve cultural, emotional, and experiential context. Presents the
  VIBE Loop (Value, Intent, Boundaries, Expression), context-engineered
  prompting, rapid prototyping, and security and responsible-AI considerations
  for building human-aligned AI systems. Presented at the UCF Institute of
  Artificial Intelligence Workshop.
type: software
